{"id":"sonne","lemma":"Sonne","pos":"noun","rank":799,"glosses":["a sun (a star, especially when being the center of a solar system)","sunshine, sunlight (the light and warmth we receive on Earth from the sun)"],"ipa":"/ˈzɔnə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/De-Sonne2.ogg/De-Sonne2.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Sonne","plural":"Sonnen"},"formAudio":{"Sonnen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Sonnen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich mag die Sonne.","en":"I like the sun.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44875","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Sonne scheint mir ins Gesicht.","en":"The sun is shining in my face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695608","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to shine","l":"scheinen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"into the"},{"g":"face"}]},{"text":"Die Sonne ist am Himmel.","en":"The sun is in the sky.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"sky"}]},{"text":"Wir sonnen uns.","en":"We're sunning ourselves.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Die Sonne geht auf.","en":"The sun is rising.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40958","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"on"}]}]}